## 3. LAYOUT AND STYLE (copied from Atkore V3)
- Arial 11. Section header: Arial 14 bold white on the theme fill, years in the same fill (`yyyy`, right aligned). Segment name row: bold, fill `FFD9E1F2`. Total rows: bold, fill `FFEBF3FB`, thin bottom border.
- Number formats: `#,##0.0;\(#,##0.0\);\-` for amounts, `0.0%;\(0.0%\);\-` for percentages. Fuso template default is `"$"#,##0`: **change to yen without a currency symbol**.
- Same columns as the model. Highlight the FY0 column (light gray `theme0 -5%`). CAGR columns V and W as in the model. Gridlines off. Column B/C hold the "Real Data / Estimates" labels.
- Order inside each block: Net sales > drivers > OP > D&A/EBITDA > capex > reconciliation.

